    {
      "source": "This is a more flexible variant of <a href=\"BeanPropertySqlParameterSource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>BeanPropertySqlParameterSource</code></a>,\nwith the limitation that it is not able to enumerate its\n<a href=\"SqlParameterSource.html#getParameterNames()\"><code>parameter names</code></a>.",
      "translation": "这是 `<a href=\"BeanPropertySqlParameterSource.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.jdbc.core.namedparam\"><code>BeanPropertySqlParameterSource</code></a>` 的一个更灵活的变体，但其限制在于无法枚举其<a href=\"SqlParameterSource.html#getParameterNames()\"><code>参数名称</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "In terms of its fallback property discovery algorithm, this class is\nsimilar to <a href=\"../../../validation/SimpleErrors.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.validation\"><code>SimpleErrors</code></a> which is\nalso just used for property retrieval purposes (rather than binding).",
